    m_UnmaskedViews: []
    MaskPreset: {fileID: 0}
  Text:
    m_Untranslated: 'Unity allows you to publish a single project to many different platforms, including mobile, console, desktop, web, and more. To publish your project to the web, you first need to switch to that platform.


      <b>Note:</b> We suggest docking the <b>Build Profiles</b> window beside the <b>Game</b> window so it''s always easily accessible.'
