  Title:
    m_Untranslated: 
  Text:
    m_Untranslated: "At the bottom of the <b>Build Profiles</b> window, select <b>Publish to Play</b>. \n\nThis opens the <b>Publish to Unity Play</b> window. \n\nSelect <b>Publish</b> to choose your most recent build, then select <b>Publish</b> again to publish it as a <b>New game</b>. "
